@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@kasirToken = ganti-dengan-jwt-kasir
@waliToken = ganti-dengan-jwt-orang-tua
@token = ganti-dengan-jwt-admin
@mfaChallenge = ganti-dengan-challenge-token
@mfaCode = 123456
@adminUsername = ganti-dengan-admin-yang-diprovisikan
@adminPassword = ganti-dengan-password-admin
@secondAdminToken = ganti-dengan-token-admin-kedua
@financialApprovalId = isi-dari-response-permintaan

# Ganti nilai ID berikut memakai ID dari response API.
@santriId = 10
@santriIdKedua = 33
@kantinId = 4
@waliRelasiId = 26
@waliAkunId = 26
@credentialId = 1
@kasirUserId = 0

### Login admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{adminUsername}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### Jika login mengembalikan mfa_enrollment_required=true, gunakan challenge token untuk setup
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/mfa/setup
Authorization: Bearer {{mfaChallenge}}

### Verifikasi kode MFA dari aplikasi authenticator; response berisi token akses
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/mfa/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{mfaChallenge}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "{{mfaCode}}"
}

### Audit log perubahan API dan status autentikasi (admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/audit-logs?page=1&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard admin
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==================== SANTRI ====================

### Daftar santri
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/santri?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cari santri
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/santri?search=Ahmad&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buat santri sekaligus akun login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/santri
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "santri_baru",
  "password": "password-kuat-123",
  "nis": "S-TEST-0001",
  "nama_lengkap": "Nama Santri Baru",
  "asrama": "Asrama A",
  "limit_harian": 50000
}

### Detail santri (ganti @santriId)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/santri/{{santriId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ubah data santri dengan PUT
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/santri/{{santriId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nis": "S-TEST-0001",
  "nama_lengkap": "Nama Santri Uji",
  "asrama": "Asrama B",
  "limit_harian": 60000,
  "username": "santri_uji",
  "password": "password-santri-uji-12345"
}

### Ubah sebagian data santri dengan PATCH
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/santri/{{santriId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "asrama": "Asrama C",
  "limit_harian": 55000
}

### Top up saldo santri
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/santri/{{santriId}}/topup
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: topup-{{santriId}}-000001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jumlah": 25000,
  "keterangan": "Top up tunai"
}

### Minta persetujuan admin kedua untuk transaksi di atas ambang
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/financial-approvals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "santri_topup",
  "resource_id": {{santriId}},
  "jumlah": 600000,
  "keterangan": "Top up bernilai besar"
}

### Admin kedua (akun berbeda dengan peminta) menyetujui permintaan
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/financial-approvals/{{financialApprovalId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{secondAdminToken}}

### Eksekusi transaksi hanya oleh peminta; approval hanya bisa dipakai sekali
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/santri/{{santriId}}/topup
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: topup-{{santriId}}-high-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jumlah": 600000,
  "keterangan": "Top up bernilai besar",
  "approval_id": {{financialApprovalId}}
}

### Tarik saldo santri
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/santri/{{santriId}}/tarik
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: tarik-{{santriId}}-000001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jumlah": 5000,
  "keterangan": "Pencairan saldo santri"
}

### Daftarkan kartu RFID santri
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/santri/{{santriId}}/kartu
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rfid_uid": "RFID-UID-UNIK-001"
}

### Daftarkan sidik jari santri
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/santri/{{santriId}}/sidik-jari
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fingerprint_id": 12345
}

### Nonaktifkan santri (saldo dan riwayat transaksi tetap tersimpan)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/santri/{{santriId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==================== KANTIN ====================

### Daftar kantin
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/kantin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buat kantin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/kantin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Kantin Putri",
  "lokasi": "Area asrama putri",
  "status": "active"
}

### Detail kantin
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/kantin/{{kantinId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ubah data kantin dengan PUT
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/kantin/{{kantinId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Kantin Putra Utama",
  "lokasi": "Gedung asrama putra",
  "status": "active"
}

### Ubah sebagian data kantin dengan PATCH
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/kantin/{{kantinId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "inactive"
}

### Catat transaksi belanja santri; saldo kantin otomatis bertambah
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/kantin/{{kantinId}}/penjualan
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: admin-sale-000001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "santri_id": {{santriId}},
  "jumlah": 12000,
  "keterangan": "Belanja makan"
}

### Cairkan saldo kantin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/kantin/{{kantinId}}/pencairan
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: payout-{{kantinId}}-000001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jumlah": 1000,
  "keterangan": "Pencairan hasil penjualan"
}

### Riwayat saldo/transaksi kantin
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/kantin/{{kantinId}}/transaksi?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Nonaktifkan kantin (saldo dan riwayat tetap tersimpan)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/kantin/{{kantinId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==================== TRANSAKSI ====================

### Daftar seluruh transaksi
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/transaksi?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter transaksi berdasarkan santri
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/transaksi?santri_id={{santriId}}&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter transaksi berdasarkan jenis (belanja, topup, tarik)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/transaksi?tipe_transaksi=topup&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==================== WALI SANTRI (DATA RELASI) ====================

### Daftar relasi wali-santri
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/wali
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buat data wali dan akun login yang terhubung ke satu santri
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/wali
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "wali_santri_baru",
  "password": "password-wali-123",
  "santri_id": {{santriId}},
  "no_whatsapp": "081234567890"
}

### Detail relasi wali-santri
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/wali/{{waliRelasiId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ubah relasi wali-santri dengan PUT (username dan password harus dikirim bersama)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/wali/{{waliRelasiId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "wali_santri_baru",
  "password": "password-wali-baru-123",
  "santri_id": {{santriId}},
  "no_whatsapp": "081234567891"
}

### Ubah sebagian relasi wali-santri dengan PATCH
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/wali/{{waliRelasiId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "no_whatsapp": "081234567892"
}

### Hapus data relasi wali-santri dan akun login jika tidak lagi punya relasi
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/wali/{{waliRelasiId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==================== AKUN ORANG TUA + HUBUNGAN ANAK ====================

### Daftar akun orang tua dan anak-anak yang terhubung
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/wali-akun
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buat akun orang tua dengan satu atau beberapa anak
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/wali-akun
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "orang_tua_baru",
  "password": "password-orang-tua-123",
  "santri_ids": [{{santriId}}, {{santriIdKedua}}],
  "no_whatsapp": "081234567890"
}

### Detail akun orang tua beserta anak-anak
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/wali-akun/{{waliAkunId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ubah sebagian akun orang tua dengan PATCH
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/wali-akun/{{waliAkunId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "no_whatsapp": "081234567892"
}

### Ubah username/password/nomor WhatsApp akun orang tua
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/wali-akun/{{waliAkunId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "orang_tua_diperbarui",
  "password": "password-orang-tua-baru-123",
  "no_whatsapp": "081234567891"
}

### Tambahkan hubungan anak ke akun orang tua
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/wali-akun/{{waliAkunId}}/anak
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "santri_id": {{santriIdKedua}},
  "no_whatsapp": "081234567891"
}

### Lepaskan hubungan anak dari akun orang tua
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/wali-akun/{{waliAkunId}}/anak/{{santriIdKedua}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Hapus akun orang tua beserta semua relasi anak
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/wali-akun/{{waliAkunId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==================== KREDENSIAL RFID/FINGERPRINT ====================

### Daftar seluruh kredensial santri
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/credentials
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buat satu atau beberapa jenis kredensial lewat endpoint umum
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/credentials
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "santri_id": {{santriId}},
  "rfid_uid": "RFID-UID-UNIK-002",
  "fingerprint_id": 12346,
  "status": "active"
}

### Detail kredensial
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/credentials/{{credentialId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ubah kredensial dengan PUT
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/credentials/{{credentialId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "santri_id": {{santriId}},
  "rfid_uid": "RFID-UID-UNIK-003",
  "fingerprint_id": 12347,
  "status": "active"
}

### Ubah sebagian kredensial dengan PATCH (contoh blokir)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/credentials/{{credentialId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "blocked"
}

### Hapus kredensial
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/credentials/{{credentialId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==================== PENUGASAN AKUN KASIR ====================

### Buat akun kasir lewat endpoint admin user (set role kasir)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "kasir_uji",
  "password": "password-kasir-123",
  "role": "kasir"
}

### Daftar kasir yang ditugaskan ke kantin
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/kantin/{{kantinId}}/kasir
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tugaskan akun role kasir ke kantin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/kantin/{{kantinId}}/kasir
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": {{kasirUserId}}
}

### Cabut penugasan kasir dari kantin
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/kantin/{{kantinId}}/kasir/{{kasirUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==================== API KASIR ====================

### Login kasir (ambil token lalu isi @kasirToken)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "kasir_uji",
  "password": "password-kasir-123"
}

### Daftar kantin yang ditugaskan ke kasir
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/kantin
Authorization: Bearer {{kasirToken}}

### Detail kantin dan saldo
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/kantin/{{kantinId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{kasirToken}}

### Saldo kantin
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/kantin/{{kantinId}}/saldo
Authorization: Bearer {{kasirToken}}

### Cari santri dengan kartu RFID aktif
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/kantin/{{kantinId}}/santri/lookup
Authorization: Bearer {{kasirToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rfid_uid": "RFID-UID-UNIK-001"
}

### Cari santri dengan NIS
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/kantin/{{kantinId}}/santri/lookup
Authorization: Bearer {{kasirToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nis": "S-TEST-0001"
}

### Cari santri dengan fingerprint yang aktif
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/kantin/{{kantinId}}/santri/lookup
Authorization: Bearer {{kasirToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fingerprint_id": 12345
}

### Catat penjualan (Idempotency-Key wajib; key unik untuk setiap transaksi)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/kantin/{{kantinId}}/penjualan
Authorization: Bearer {{kasirToken}}
Idempotency-Key: test-penjualan-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "santri_id": {{santriId}},
  "jumlah": 12000,
  "keterangan": "Belanja makan"
}

### Retry penjualan yang sama jika respons sebelumnya timeout (key dan body harus sama)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/kantin/{{kantinId}}/penjualan
Authorization: Bearer {{kasirToken}}
Idempotency-Key: test-penjualan-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "santri_id": {{santriId}},
  "jumlah": 12000,
  "keterangan": "Belanja makan"
}

### Riwayat penjualan dan pencairan kantin
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/kantin/{{kantinId}}/transaksi?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{kasirToken}}

### Filter riwayat penjualan
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/kantin/{{kantinId}}/transaksi?tipe_transaksi=penjualan&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{kasirToken}}

### Filter riwayat pencairan kantin (admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/kantin/{{kantinId}}/transaksi?tipe_transaksi=pencairan&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==================== API ORANG TUA ====================

### Login orang tua (ambil token lalu isi @waliToken)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "orang_tua_baru",
  "password": "password-orang-tua-123"
}

### Profil orang tua dan anak yang terhubung
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wali/me
Authorization: Bearer {{waliToken}}

### Daftar anak, saldo, dan belanja hari ini
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wali/anak
Authorization: Bearer {{waliToken}}

### Detail anak beserta saldo dan limit harian
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wali/anak/{{santriId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{waliToken}}

### Riwayat transaksi anak
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wali/anak/{{santriId}}/transaksi?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{waliToken}}

### Atur limit belanja harian anak (PUT juga tersedia)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/wali/anak/{{santriId}}/limit-harian
Authorization: Bearer {{waliToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "limit_harian": 30000
}
